[[Lore:Korvag Crag|Korvag Crag]] was a location in ancient [[Lore:Skyrim|Skyrim]]. It was the dwelling of [[Lore:Troll|trolls]] who defeated and devoured all the members of the Sisterhood of the White Rose. A [[Lore:Word Walls|Word Wall]] was erected to commemorate the bitter defeat of the Sisterhood.{{Ref|name=WW|[[Skyrim:Word Wall#Disarm|Disarm Word Wall]] in ''[[Skyrim:Skyrim|Skyrim]]''}}{{Ref|name=Disarm|[[Skyrim:Disarm|Disarm]] shout in ''[[Skyrim:Skyrim|Skyrim]]''}}<noinclude>{{NewLine}}
